cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "mycelium-tdoa: an open simulation testbed for TDOA source localisation on living mycelium"
abstract: >-
  An open, reproducible simulation framework for time-difference-of-arrival (TDOA)
  source localisation on a living mycelial substrate: an anisotropic, heterogeneous
  travel-time medium model, regularised GCC-PHAT delay estimation, a Gaussian-process
  fingerprinting localiser, and a medium-aware Cramer-Rao identifiability analysis.
type: software
authors:
